This product is a Go implementation of the Eclipse Zenoh protocol. It was
written largely by an AI model (Anthropic's Claude) from the Zenoh protocol
specification and from the source code of Eclipse Zenoh (zenoh-rust,
https://github.com/eclipse-zenoh/zenoh), whose algorithms, wire formats,
configuration formats and behaviour it reproduces. Eclipse Zenoh is
Copyright (c) 2017, 2024 ZettaScale Technology and the Eclipse Zenoh
contributors, and is made available under the terms of the Eclipse Public
License 2.0 or the Apache License 2.0 (EPL-2.0 OR Apache-2.0).

Test vectors in zext and keyexpr are taken from zenoh-rust's tests.
